MAADILI YETU
Bidii;
Tiunafanaya kazi kwa bidii kwa kuzingatia ujuzi, utaalamu na nidhamu ya hali ya juu.
Uadilifu;
Tunatekeleza majukumu kwa uadilifu mkubwa kwa kuzingatia maadili ya kazi zetu.
Kumjali Mteja;
Tunawajali wateja wetu kwa kuwasaidia kufikia matarajio yao.
Kufanya kazi kama timu;
Tunafanya kazi kwa kushirikiana, kubadilishana uzoefu, ujuzi na kupeana taarifa sahihi.
Uwajibikaji;
Tunawahudumia wateja kwa muda uliowekwa.
Heshima;
Tunawasikiliza wateja na kuwahudumia kwa heshima

pages.text_en:
PURPOSE OF THE CLIENT SERVICE CHARTER
This Client Service Charter aims to enhance accountability at the Regional Commissioner’s Office, Kilimanjaro, by informing clients about the services provided. Through this Charter, clients will be made aware of the services offered, the standards of those services, and the mechanisms for receiving feedback from our clients.
Furthermore, this Charter outlines the rights and obligations of clients, as well as the responsibilities of the Regional Commissioner’s Office in ensuring the delivery of quality services at all times.
OUR CLIENTS
Prime Ministers Office – Regional Administration and Local Government (PO-RALG);
President’s Office – Public Service Management and Good Governance;
Ministries, Regional Secretariats, Independent Departments, Government Agencies, Public Corporations/Authorities/Institutions, and Local Government Authorities (LGAs);
Citizens;
Private sector;
Public and non-public servants;
Politicians and political parties;
Investors;
Non-Governmental Organizations (NGOs); and
Media.

pages.text_sw:
MADHUMUNI YA MKATABA WA HUDUMA KWA MTEJA
Mkataba huu wa Huduma kwa Mteja unalenga kuongeza uwajibikaji wa Ofisi ya Mkuu wa Mkoa wa Kilimanjaro kwa kuwafahamisha wateja kuhusu huduma zinazotolewa. Kupitia Mkataba huu, wateja watatambua huduma zinazotolewa, viwango vya huduma hizo pamoja na njia za kupokea mrejesho kutoka kwa wateja wetu. Aidha, Mkataba huu unabainisha haki na wajibu wa wateja pamoja na wajibu wa Ofisi ya Mkuu wa Mkoa katika kufikia utoaji huduma bora wakati wote.
WATEJA WETU
Ofisi ya Waziri Mkuu – TAMISEMI;
Ofisi ya Rais – Menejimenti ya Utumishi wa Umma na Utawala Bora;
Wizara, Sekretarieti za Mikoa, Idara Zinazojitegemea, Wakala za Serikali, Mashirika ya Umma/Mamlaka/Taasisi na Mamlaka za Serikali za Mitaa;
Wananchi;
Sekta binafsi;
Watumishi wa umma na wasio wa umma;
Wanasiasa na vyama vya siasa;
Wawekezaji;
Mashikika yasiyo ya kiserikali (NGOs); na
Vyombo vya habari.
